<title>USA: Enhance says Swiss Re adds to stake.</title>
<headline>Enhance says Swiss Re adds to stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enhance Financial Services Group Inc said on Tuesday that Swiss Reinsurance Co has purchased an additional 700,000 shares of Enhance Group common stock for $39.00 per share, raising its stake to 9.1 percent.</p>
<p>Swiss Re purchased the shares from existing shareholders and increased its ownership to 1.7 million shares, Enhance Financial said.</p>
<p>Swiss Re purchased its initial one million Enhance common shares in February and March 1996, when Swiss Re and Enhance Group initiated a strategic alliance, Enhance Financial said.</p>
</text>
